re\\\" cleared end date value (\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\") and set disabled=true; preview shows \\\"Jul 2022 - Present\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No persistence across reload; all changes lost\", \"actual\": \"Before reload the dashboard had 5 resumes (created \\\"Product Manager Application\\\", duplicate renamed \\\"Senior PM Application\\\", deleted \\\"Data Analyst Variation\\\", 3 seeds). After reloading http://localhost:6005/ only the 3 original seed resumes remain: created/edited/duplicated/renamed resumes are gone and the deleted one's removal is irrelevant since state resets to defaults. localStorage and sessionStorage are both empty — state is in-memory only.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Whitespace-only title accepted by dashboard rename dialog; no validation feedback anywhere\", \"actual\": \"Dashboard card > Rename > entered \\\"   \\\" and clicked Save: dialog closed and the resume title became \\\"   \\\" (card heading is blank/whitespace), no error shown. In the editor's inline title field, empty/whitespace input silently reverts to the old title with no validation message (0 toasts, no inline error).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing name/email/summary/experience fields updated Live Preview immediately with no save action; template selection also updated preview styling instantly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Moving Skills above Education and toggling Education visibility updated the preview instantly; after navigating tabs, going to dashboard and reopening, the section order (Contact, About Me, Career History, Core Competencies, Academics) and visibility states were preserved in both editor and preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No save button needed: edits auto-retained across tab switches, dashboard return, and reopening. Dashboard card showed \\\"Updated Aug 27, 2026\\\" (today) after editing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Preview renders all visible sections with content (contact, summary, experience x2, education, skills) in Modern/Classic/Minimal; when content exceeded the viewport the page scrolled (docScrollHeight 998 > 900) and the full resume down to the last education entry was reachable.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After switching tabs, returning to dashboard and reopening the resume, contact fields (Alice Johnson/alice@example.com/(555) 987-6543/Boston, MA/linkedin/website), summary, both experience entries, MIT education and 3 skills are all still present in editor and preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy edited (name→\\\"Alice J. Copy\\\", location→Seattle, WA): original still \\\"Alice Johnson\\\"/\\\"Boston, MA\\\". Original then edited (phone→(555) 111-2222): copy still shows (555) 987-6543.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed to \\\"Product Manager Application\\\"; editor header shows that title and the dashboard card heading shows \\\"Product Manager Application\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Customized summary heading not rendered in Minimal style\", \"actual\": \"Renamed section headings to About Me / Career History / Core Competencies / Academics. Modern and Classic previews show all four. Minimal preview omits the Summary heading entirely (h2 list = Career History, Core Competencies, Academics); only the summary body text is shown, so \\\"About Me\\\" never appears.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
